      "title": "Thomas Markle, Meghan’s father, is competent to face child sex abuse images case",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/19/thomas-markle-mentally-competent",
      "description": "<p>Judge in Florida says an expert has determined the 82-year-old estranged father of the Duchess of Sussex is mentally competent to face charges</p><p>An expert has determined that Thomas Markle, the 82-year-old estranged father of the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/meghan-duchess-of-sussex\">Duchess of Sussex</a>, is mentally competent to face charges of keeping child sexual abuse material in storage in California, a judge said on Thursday.</p><p>Markle’s defense lawyer said they would not contest the finding by Dr Amie Gerodimos. The exam was ordered after his arrest at a senior care center in Lakeland, Florida, on 6 November.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/19/thomas-markle-mentally-competent\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-19T22:05:18"
